Q: How to preview multiple views in the same canvas SwiftUI A: <p>You can still add multiple previews by using the new SwiftUI macro.</p>
<p>You will see the preview tabs in the canvas section.</p>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>#Preview(&quot;On&quot;) {
    Button(&quot;hello on&quot;)
}

#Preview(&quot;Off&quot;) {
    Button(&quot;hello off&quot;)
}
</code></pre>
